ports, authentication and network behaviour are not covered, and the outsider needed only transport reachability.\\\",\n  \\\"The entry phase used one command entry with no configuration semantics, so the FSM effect recorded is a single applied command.\\\",\n  \\\"The probe does not measure how long the empty configuration persists in a cluster without membership traffic; that follows from the repair path rather than from a timed observation.\\\",\n  \\\"The live-cluster run uses one three-voter in-memory cluster with timers shortened to 200 ms, one restarted follower and one outsider request; whether the cluster recovered a leader after the displacement was not measured, and the term the outsider could impose through a single quiet window is not bounded in time.\\\"]\n}]}\nopen('update.json','w').write(json.dumps(u,indent=2)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nprint('written')\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0,'/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-15_18-00-28-hashicorp_raft-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | tail -3; date -u\"","aggregated_output":"written\n{\"valid\": true, \"run_id\": \"1bdd60fe5af14a33879d92997922e21b\", \"elapsed_seconds\": 4601.040733945018, \"diagnostics\": [], \"meaning\": \"Read-only validation of these bytes and saved state; no acceptance, execution or budget reservation\", \"no_change\": false, \"execution_requested\": false, \"effects\": [{\"object\": \"interpretations\", \"action\": \"append\", \"target\": \"interpretations[0]\", \"investigation_id\": \"7e10640e7212486b94a80f04b69febc2-question-1\", \"changed_fields\": [\"executions\", \"rationale\", \"counterevidence\", \"limitations\", \"joint_history\"]}]}\nThu Oct 15 11:17:30 UTC 2026\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
